Munich is not only a beautiful city but also a place where MRI research thrives! 🧲 
I am pleased to announce that our lab will host this year's Deutsche Sektion ISMRM (DACH-ISMRM) Labtour "Hyper and Hops" organized by Dr. Martin Grashei.

@ISMRM @TU_Muenchen https://t.co/jw800Pcr31

The DFG funds our HyperMet research unit! We will investigate the metabolic health effects of muscle hypertrophy and atrophy using advanced methods of metabolic research. Congratulations to everyone and thanks to our speaker @HeWaHippo 
